# still readable in this repository's history by anyone who can clone it: LMS
# API keys, a Subsonic API key, and a personal username/password pair.
#
# Rewriting history to remove them is not on the table - it would invalidate
# every existing clone and all 204 tags - so the fix is to rotate the
