#
# They are listed here by exact fingerprint rather than by path on purpose: a
# new commit of either file, or a new secret on a different line, still fails
# the scan. Delete an entry once the credential behind it has been rotated and
# the value in history is worthless. Until then, this list is the to-do list.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

